{"pin":"BB00079","subcodes":[{"code":"BB00079","anchor":"","title":"Epistle to Muhammad Shah 4","first_line":"Praise and glory, beyond comparison and likeness, befit the Supreme, the Ever-Living and Eternal Lord, who hath existed from time immemorial, while naught hath ever approached the sanctified precincts of His holiness [4o]... ...The substance wherewith God hath created Me is not the clay out of which others have been formed","first_line_orig":"هو المتکبرالعلی الاعلی. حمد و سپاس بی مثل و قیاس حضرت حی قیوم را سزاست که لم یزل بوده و شیء در ساحت قدس  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"2500","subjects":"@transcendence; unknowability of God, @station of the Manifestation of God, @suffering and imprisonment, @the Word of God; influence and centrality of, @the Bab; the Primal Point; station and claims of the Bab, @prophecy and fulfillment","notes":" \u003ca href=\"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/AHDA.pdf#page=474\"\u003eAHDA.460.08\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/1504.pdf#page=35\"\u003eMMAH.023?\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://www.loomofreality.org/sources/SRC.pdf#page=35\"\u003eSRC.097\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://www.loomofreality.org/sources/SRC.pdf#page=46\"\u003eSRC.193\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swb","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of the Báb","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swb","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of the Báb","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA64:103.05-126.08","source":"INBA64","locator":"103.05-126.08","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v064/?page=105"},{"kind":"music","code":"Naim Z, Naim S \u0026 Negin","source":"Naim Z, Naim S \u0026 Negin","url":"https://youtu.be/8qH6yCWVEBc"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHDA.299","source":"AHDA","locator":"299","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/AHDA.pdf#page=313"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ASAT4.368-